{"evidence":[{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Mathilde Lemoine (born September 1969) is a French economist.","title":"Mathilde Lemoine"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" She is currently the Group Chief Economist of Edmond de Rothschild.","title":"Mathilde Lemoine"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" She is also a member of the French High Council of Public Finances and an independent Director of retailer Carrefour Group.","title":"Mathilde Lemoine"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Edmond de Rothschild Group is an international, family-owned and independent financial group, specialised in private banking, asset management, private equity, corporate finance and funds administration.","title":"Edmond de Rothschild Group"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Mirae Asset Financial Group is an independent financial services group in Asia, headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","title":"Mirae Asset Group"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" While the group’s core business is asset management, it also provides comprehensive financial services in the areas of wealth management and life insurance.","title":"Mirae Asset Group"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" Mirae Asset was founded by Hyeon Joo Park in 1997 and introduced the very first mutual funds to Korean retail investors in 1998.","title":"Mirae Asset Group"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Convoy Global Holdings Limited (, ) is a member of Convoy Financial Group.","title":"Convoy Financial Services"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" Through its wholly owned subsidiary, Convoy Financial Services Limited (), the company is an Independent Financial Advisor (IFA) in Hong Kong which provides financial planning services, risk management, retirement planning and estate planning.","title":"Convoy Financial Services"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" It is the largest independent insurance and MPF schemes brokerage firm in Hong Kong in terms of number of consultants.","title":"Convoy Financial Services"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" Convoy Financial Services Limited is both a member of Professional Insurance Brokers Association and is registered as an Mandatory Provident Fund Corporate Intermediary under the Mandatory Provident Fund Schemes Authority.","title":"Convoy Financial Services"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"ICB Banking Group also referred to as Swiss Finance Lexomburg AG or ICB Financial Group, but commonly known as International Commercial Bank (ICB), is an International financial services provider based in Schindellegi, Switzerland, with subsidiaries in Eastern Europe, Africa and Asia.","title":"ICB Banking Group"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" The parent company of the group is known as ICB Financial Group Holdings AG whose stock is listed on the London Stock Exchange under the symbol: ICB.","title":"ICB Banking Group"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" , ICB Banking Group was a large financial services provider with total assets in excess of US$1.32 billion and shareholders' equity in excess of US$200 million.","title":"ICB Banking Group"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Cetera Financial Group (commonly referred to as Cetera) is a shared service organization serving affiliates that comprise the second-largest family of independent broker-dealers in the United States.","title":"Cetera Financial Group"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" The company has nearly 8,000 financial advisors , is a leading provider of retail financial services to investment programs of banks and credit unions, and has over $224.5 billion in advisory and brokerage assets under advisement, generating approximately $1.6 billion in annual revenue for the 2016 fiscal year.","title":"Cetera Financial Group"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" “Cetera Financial Group” refers to the network of independent retail firms encompassing, among others, Cetera Advisors, Cetera Advisor Networks, Cetera Investment Services (marketed as Cetera Financial Institutions), Cetera Financial Specialists, First Allied Securities, Girard and Summit Brokerage Services.","title":"Cetera Financial Group"},{"sentence_id":3,"text":" All firms are members FINRA/ SIPC.","title":"Cetera Financial Group"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Edmond de Rothschild Group
